{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-98609:  php8.4 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[8.4.27-2.1]\n- Increment release for new build\n\n[8.4.27-2]\n- rebase to 8.4.27\n\n[8.4.24-2]\n- rebase to 8.4.24\n\n[8.4.23-2]\n- rebase to 8.4.23\n- do not provide 'php-devel'\n\n[8.4.21-2]\n- rebase to 8.4.21\n\n[8.4.16-2]\n- add missing bundled() for lexbor library RHEL-165957\n\n[8.4.16-1]\n- rebase to 8.4.16\n\n[8.4.14-4]\n- fix the package descriptions\n- add missing dependency on net-snmp\n\n[8.4.15-3]\n- fix tmpfiles.d configuration file name\n- fix spec file name\n\n[8.4.14-1]\n- Update to 8.4.14 - http://www.php.net/releases/8_4_14.php",
